I setup kodecloud to learn linux
I did one question of setting up apache isolated server for web appliation , and created a user named jim with uid = 1738 and with a home directory /var/www/jim
first i connected it to an apache server with the command
`ssh <username>@stapp02` to connect to server 2 
and then 
`sudo useradd -u 1738 -d /var/www/jim -m jim`
-m : to create a home directory if it doesn't exist 
now we can check it with the command 
`id jim`
